\pard\sa120\sb120\fs24\b Validate build parameters\b0{\*\bkmkstart validate-build-parameters}{\*\bkmkend validate-build-parameters}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Reuses the shared {\f1 Resolve-ExternalIsoPath\f0} helper (the single resolver used by every deploy/build command) to convert a network-share Windows ISO image path - and optionally firmware component locations - into the network address the iLO BMC mounts as virtual media, then verifies each file is present and usable. On success it returns the resolved iLO URL(s) so you can pass them straight to a deploy command. Local drive paths ({\f1 C:\\\f0}, {\f1 H:\\\f0} on a local disk) are rejected because iLO cannot reach local drives.\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Accepted formats: {\f1 \\\\server\\share\\file.iso\f0} (UNC), {\f1 //server/share/file.iso\f0} (forward-slash UNC - identical to the above), {\f1 cifs://server/share/file.iso\f0}, {\f1 smb://server/share/file.iso\f0}, {\f1 https://...\f0} / {\f1 nfs://...\f0} URLs, or a mapped network drive ({\f1 H:\\file.iso\f0}).\par
\pard\li360\ri360\sa80\fs22\i \b Full format reference:\b0 see Path Parameter Formats for every accepted {\f1 -ExternalIsoPath\f0} / {\f1 -IsoPath\f0} / {\f1 -FirmwareFolders\f0} format, including the single-slash {\f1 /server/share\f0} autocorrection and the list of unsupported local paths.\i0\par
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # UNC/SMB share (backslash or forward slash) - resolved to a cifs:// URL iLO can mountTest-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath '\\\\fileserver\\isos\\WinSrv2025.iso'Test-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath '//fileserver/isos/WinSrv2025.iso'\f0}\par}
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # CIFS/SMB URL or HTTPS URL - used directly by iLOTest-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath 'cifs://fileserver/isos/WinSrv2025.iso'Test-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath 'https://artifacts/isos/WinSrv2025.iso'\f0}\par}
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # Validate ISO + firmware locations together (same shared resolver for both)Test-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath '\\\\fileserver\\isos\\WinSrv2025.iso' ` -FirmwareFolders @('\\\\fileserver\\fw\\BIOS', 'H:\\fw\\iLO5')\f0}\par}
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # Validate the path format only (skip checking the files exist)Test-BuildParams -BaseIsoPath '\\\\fileserver\\isos\\WinSrv2025.iso' -DryRun\f0}\par}
\pard\sa80\fs22 \b Returns:\b0 {\f1 [hashtable]\f0} with {\f1 Success\f0}, {\f1 BaseIsoPath\f0}, {\f1 IsoUrl\f0} (resolved cifs://, https://, or nfs:// address iLO uses), {\f1 ResolvedPath\f0}, {\f1 FirmwareResults\f0} (per-location {\f1 \{Location, ResolvedUrl, Exists, Error\}\f0}), and {\f1 Errors\f0} (array; empty when valid). On success {\f1 IsoUrl\f0} holds the converted share address.\par
