\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Physical Server Build (End-to-End)\b0{\*\bkmkstart physical-server-build-end-to-end}{\*\bkmkend physical-server-build-end-to-end}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 The full runbook workflow in one command: pre-build validation, ConfigMgr bootable ISO, OneView target resolution, iLO Redfish mount + boot, installation monitoring, post-build validation, firmware update, and audit logging. Supports two modes:\par
\pard\li360\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab \b Build mode\b0 (default): Builds a ConfigMgr bootable ISO and deploys it.\par\pard\li360\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab \b External ISO mode\b0 ({\f1 -ExternalIsoPath\f0}): Deploys a client-supplied ISO directly from a network share (UNC/SMB, {\f1 cifs://\f0}, {\f1 smb://\f0}, or HTTPS), skipping build and publish entirely.\par
\pard\li360\ri360\sa80\fs22\i \b ConfigMgr parameters\b0 ({\f1 -SiteCode\f0}, {\f1 -ManagementPoint\f0}, {\f1 -DistributionPoint\f0}, {\f1 -BootImageName\f0}, {\f1 -TaskSequenceName\f0}, {\f1 -SiteServer\f0}): only needed in \b Build mode\b0. When using {\f1 -ExternalIsoPath\f0}, these are not required because the ISO build/publish steps are skipped.\i0\par
\pard\sa120\sb120\fs24\b Configure build (4-eye review)\b0{\*\bkmkstart configure-build-4-eye-review}{\*\bkmkend configure-build-4-eye-review}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Use {\f1 Configure-PhysicalBuild\f0} to review the full deployment plan before anything destructive happens. The review itself makes \b no changes\b0 - it resolves server identity from OneView, validates ISO reachability, runs pre-build checks, and prints a comprehensive summary including all destructive actions that the build/deploy will perform. However, it is the \b authorization gate\b0: typing {\f1 APPROVE\f0} or passing {\f1 -Deploy\f0} (alias {\f1 -Execute\f0}) releases the destructive build and deploy of the iso image and firmware files being written to the designated server.\par
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # Full 4-eye review with confirmation promptConfigure-PhysicalBuild -ServerIdentifier srv01 -OneViewHost oneview.corp.local -IloIp 10.0.1.50 ` -SiteCode P01 -ManagementPoint mp01.corp.local -DistributionPoint dp01.corp.local ` -Domain corp.local -GuardRail 'srv01'\f0}\par}
{\pard\sa80\sb80\fs20\fi0\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clcbpat2\cf2{\f1 # Non-interactive deploy - passes -Deploy to skip the prompt and run immediatelyConfigure-PhysicalBuild -ServerIdentifier srv01 -OneViewHost oneview.corp.local -ExternalIsoPath 'https://artifacts/isos/win2025.iso' -Deploy -GuardRail 'srv01'\f0}\par}
